<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-WORLD TEAM CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WORLD TEAM CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>DUESSELDORF, Germany 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of World</p>
<p>Team Cup tennis matches on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Red Group:</p>
<p>Croatia beat Czech Republic 2-1 (match level 1-1 on Tuesday)</p>
<p>(Croatian names first):</p>
<p>Goran Ivanisevic/Sasa Hirszon beat Daniel Vacek/Martin Damm 5-7</p>
<p>6-4 6-3</p>
